body:
When `emailRedirectTo` is set in `signInWithOtp` options, Supabase interprets the flow as magic-link and embeds a clickable sign-in URL in the email instead of a plain 6-digit code.

## Change

Removed `emailRedirectTo` from both signup and signin `otpOptions` in `handleSendOtp`:

```js
// Before
const otpOptions = mode === 'signup'
  ? { shouldCreateUser: true, data: { player_name: name }, emailRedirectTo: window.location.origin }
  : { shouldCreateUser: false, emailRedirectTo: window.location.origin }

// After
const otpOptions = mode === 'signup'
  ? { shouldCreateUser: true, data: { player_name: name } }
  : { shouldCreateUser: false }
```

Supabase now sends a plain OTP email for both signup and signin flows.
